  - State: `setAsActive: boolean` (init: `true`), `publishError: string | null` (init: `null`), `lastPublishedVersion: string | null` (init: `null`)
  - Actions: `toggleSetAsActive(value?)`, `startPublish()`, `setPublishError(error)`
